+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Theorem 4.29 and equation (4.7) make the coefficient witness "
+        "computable by a fast Walsh-Hadamard inversion in O(n log n); at the "
+        "shipping preset its measured wall-clock and exact-operation count are "
+        "recorded by selftest, while the unit-character route uses at most 133 "
