codex
Implemented a native Track B generator based on the paper’s Walsh Perron similarities ([arXiv paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2409.07682)).

Local verification passes:

- 12/12 planted witnesses
- 0/200,000 structure-aware guesses
- Five attacks at 0/8 each
- Exact answer space: 1,156,576,495,205,226,332,160
- Reference FWHT: 13,319 operations
- Compact route: at most 161 operations
- G8: 140/140 relabelling invariance checks
- Answer: 155 worst-case characters and 21 atoms

