Implemented and locally verified the Track B Walsh-spectracone generator based on Theorem 4.29 and equation (4.7) of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/html/2409.07682v4).

Key deliverables:

- [gen_2409_07682.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2409.07682/gen_2409_07682.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2409.07682/selftest_report.json)
- [README.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2409.07682/README.md)
- [llm_loop_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2409.07682/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2409.07682/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2409.07682/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

Local results:

- All G1–G9(c) gates pass.
- G1 rechecked on all four presets and three seeds: 12/12.
- G4: 0/200,000 structure-aware guesses.
- G6: five attacks each succeeded 0/8.
- Reference FWHT algorithm solves 8/8, as expected for Track B.
