Local verification is now stable: all 12 planted cases still pass after the renderer and hot-path fixes. I’m doing one final independent algebra check on the demo—explicitly forming \(S\,\mathrm{diag}(\lambda)\,S^{-1}\)—plus schema and transcript consistency checks before handing off the quota blocker.
