codex
Implemented a native Track B generator based on the paper’s Walsh spectracone results ([Theorem 4.29 and Equation 4.7](https://arxiv.org/html/2409.07682)).

Deliverables:

- [gen_2409_07682.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2409.07682/gen_2409_07682.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2409.07682/selftest_report.json)
- [README.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2409.07682/README.md)
- [llm_loop_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2409.07682/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2409.07682/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2409.07682/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

Local gates pass:

- G1: 12/12 planted witnesses
- G4: 0/200,000 guesses; exact space 1,156,576,495,205,226,332,160
- G6: five attacks at 0/8 each
- Reference FWHT: 8/8, 13,319 exact operations
- Compact route: at most 161 operations
- G8: 140/140 relabelling checks
- G9(c): 155 worst-case characters, 21 atoms

The renderer was also corrected to define every term, and the verifier’s sampling hot path was optimized without weakening exact validation.

External hardening remains incomplete: every bare, structural-hint, and placebo request returned OpenRouter HTTP 403, “Key limit exceeded.” No oracle failure was counted as hardness evidence, and `SHIPPING_DIFFICULTY="easy"` remains provisional. After quota is restored, rerun:

```bash
python3 ../../scripts/harden.py gen_2409_07682.py
```

No `REJECTED.md` was created because this is an infrastructure blocker, not a G/H/V failure.
